宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">年</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 51.52%; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; HEIGHT: 24pt; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt" width="51%"><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">——</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 26.92%; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; HEIGHT: 24pt; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt" width="26%" colspan="2"><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">*</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">注：每年度发放到个人的为税后实际金额，个税由学校按国家相关政策先行扣除。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">五年项目建设周期结束之前半年内，学校与</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">可以共同委托第三方机构进行项目实施评估，并根据评估结果决定下一个周期是否资助。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 262.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 17.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 262.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 17.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd" class="MsoNormal"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi"><span style="font-size:16px">9</span></span></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><img class="anchorclass" /><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt">“</span><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095528"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt">杏坛英贤计划”项目实施方案</span></span><img class="anchorclass" /><img class="anchorclass" /><img class="anchorclass" /><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc460845530"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472094930"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095529"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt"></span></span></span></span></h1><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc460845530"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472094930"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095529"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc460845530"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472094930"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095529"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></span></span></span></p><h2 style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc460845530"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472094930"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095529"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">一、建设目的</span></span></span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></h2><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">支撑学校课程改革和文化建设的基石是学科教师队伍建设及其组织文化的培育。为进一步推进绍兴市第一中学名师队伍建设，吸引和造就学科领军人物，引领教师专业成长和学科团队发展，进而不断提升学校在课程建设与高考成绩、学科竞赛与创新人才培养、学科教学研究与实践等方面的软实力，创建和培育品牌学科及其团队，将绍兴市第一中学建设成以“存古开新、兼容并包”为特质的全国一流江南名校，特设立“杏坛英贤计划”项目。</span></p><h2 style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><img class="anchorclass" /><img class="anchorclass" /><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095530"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">二、</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">项目范围</span></h2><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">英贤教师岗位津贴：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">设置英贤教师岗位：①面向目前在校在职在岗的特级教师和正高级教师进行选聘。做好存量，充分发挥学科领军作用；②面向全国选聘省级特级教师和正高级教师。做好增量，补充目前学校重点学科和高考学科急需的学科带头人。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">英贤质量奖：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">奖励在浙江省高考和省级以上学科竞赛中取得优异成绩的教师团队。</span></p><h2 style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><img class="anchorclass" /><img class="anchorclass" /><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095531"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">三、预期成效</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></h2><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">项目价值：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">充分发挥和彰显英贤人才的引领作用，推进学科团队建设，提高教师队伍的整体育人能力和水平，进而提升学校在课程建设、人才培养、教学科研、教学管理等方面的综合实力，扩大一中教育品牌在国内、国际的知名度与影响力。</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">制度保障</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">：学校制定《绍兴市第一中学“杏坛英贤计划”实施办法》，制订各具体项目的奖励标准，并以正式文件的形式公布。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">四、实施程序</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">个人申报：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">根据《绍兴市第一中学“杏坛英贤计划”实施办法》，教师个人申报符合条件的相关奖项，报学校职能处室</span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd" class="MsoNormal"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi"><span style="font-size:16px">10</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">审核，审核结果名单报校长办公会议审议、裁定。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">职能处室分工：教科室负责“英贤教师岗位津贴”，教学处负责“英贤质量奖”。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学校评定：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">校长办公会议对职能处室上报的拟奖励名单进行严格审议、裁定，形成项目方案，在学校网站公示无异议后提交上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司审核通过。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">其中对“英贤教师岗位”中的“面向全国选聘省级特级教师和正高级教师”，需根据其年度业绩形成《绍兴市第一中学“英贤人才”项目年度考核报告》，达到既定目标后才予以按月发放岗位津贴，并在学校网站公示无异议后提交</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">组织颁发聘书：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学校在每年的开学典礼上，对受聘的英贤教师举行聘任仪式，邀请鲁家贤先生、高央先生或者其他相关人员出席并颁发聘书。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">五、监督考核</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">民主监督：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年度的选聘、奖励接受绍兴市第一中学全校师生员工的监督，过程公开、公正、公平，结果需进行公示，无异议。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">评价考核：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年度的项目执行情况（包括组织评奖、奖金使用、项目成效等）形成报告，由学校向上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司公司作专题汇报，并接受上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司的监督、考核和质询。</span></p><h2 style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><img class="anchorclass" /><img class="anchorclass" /><img class="anchorclass" /><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472094933"><span style="mso-bookmark: _Toc472095532"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">六、项目预算</span></span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></h2><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2019</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">—2023年，每年预算500万元用于本项目建设，五年共计预算2500万元。</span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm