ight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd" class="MsoNormal"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi"><span style="font-size:16px">12</span></span></p><p><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">
</span></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt">“</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt">未来英贤计划”项目实施方案</span></h1><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </span></span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><h2 style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">一、建设目的</span></h2><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">为进一步助推绍兴市第一中学的优秀人才培养，为一中学子在德行养成、文化学习、实践探索、竞赛创新等方面的高水平成长与发展提供资助与奖励，培育学生成为具有“抱定宗旨、砥砺德行、博雅通达”完全人格的未来世界精英，特设立“未来英贤计划”项目。</span></p><h2 style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">二、项目范围</span></h2><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">英贤访学奖</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">：在文化课程综合成绩优异（绍兴市大规模教学质量调测）、学科竞赛、社团建设或创新活动中取得优异成绩或者在善行义举、品德思想等方面有突出典型事迹但家庭经济条件相对困难的在校学生，资助他们出国交流访学深造，不断走向“成人、成才、成就”。</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">英贤学生奖：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">奖励在高考和学科竞赛中成绩优异、被清华大学、北京大学、复旦大学、中国人民大学、上海财经大学、上海交通大学、中国科学院大学、香港中文大学（深圳）、浙江大学录取的学生。</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">三、预期成效</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">项目价值：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">充分激励全体一中学子的成才成就愿望，引导其“抱定宗旨”并为之发奋学习，助力其在高考选考、学科竞赛、实践创新、德行成长等方面砥砺前行，成为博雅通达之才。</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">制度保障</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">：学校制定《绍兴市第一中学“未来英贤计划”实施细则》，制订各具体项目的评比奖励标准，并以正式文件的形式公布。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">四、实施程序</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">申报操作：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">根据《绍兴市第一中学“未来英贤计划”实</span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd" class="MsoNormal"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi"><span style="font-size:16px">13</span></span></p><p><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">
</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">施细则》，采取学生个人申报与组织（包括班级、年段及相关学生群团组织）推荐相结合的方式，将初选人员名单报学校职能处室审核，审核结果名单报校长办公会议审议、裁定。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">职能处室分工：党政办负责“英贤访学奖”，教学处、德育处、团委负责“英贤学生奖”。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学校评定：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学校对职能处室上报的拟奖励者名单进行严格审议、裁定，形成奖励方案，在学校网站公示无异议后提交</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">组织颁奖：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">在每年的开学典礼上，对各项目的受奖人员进行颁奖，邀请鲁家贤先生、高央先生或者其他相关人员出席并颁奖。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">五、监督考核</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">民主监督：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年度的评比奖励接受绍兴市第一中学全校师生员工的监督，过程公开、公正、公平，结果需进行公示，无异议。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">——</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">评价考核：</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年度的项目执行情况（包括组织评奖、奖金使用、项目成效等）形成报告，由学校向上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司公司作专题汇报，并接受上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司的监督、考核和质询。</span></p><h2 style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">六、项目预算</span></h2><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2019</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">—2023年，每年预算80万元用于本项目建设，五年共计预算400万元。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="