"FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd" class="MsoNormal"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi"><span style="font-size:16px">15</span></span></p><p><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">
</span></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt">“</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt">绍青英贤计划”项目实施方案</span></h1><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </span></span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">为了充分发挥优质学校示范引领作用，本着“校际统筹、以强带弱、资源共享、紧密合作、均衡发展”的原则，绍兴市第一中学（甲方）与青田中学（乙方）进行结对帮扶，以甲方的办学优势帮助乙方提升办学质量和办学水平，特设立“绍青英贤计划”项目。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">一、项目执行时间</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">五年，即2019年至2023年。五年后，双方协商是否继续结对帮扶工作。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">二、项目实施</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲乙双方分别成立以学校主要负责人为组长的结对帮扶工作领导小组，加强对帮扶工作的领导，逐步建立健全结对帮扶工作机制。双方各确定一位校级领导为帮扶项目具体负责人，负责制订每学年帮扶行事历（甲方牵头，一般在每年8月底前完成）并组织实施。确定双方办公室负责人为联络员，负责沟通联系。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">三、项目内容</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（一）教师层面</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲乙双方每学年定期派团（一般安排在4月和10月，每次人数在10人左右）到对方学校考察交流。派出方提早一周征求接收方意见，并共同设计活动内容。每次确定一个主题，根据主题确定派出人选。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">乙方定期选派教师到甲方跟岗学习，学习时间一般为一个学期，甲方指定优秀教师专人指导。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲方安排本校优秀教师（优秀班主任）担任指导教师，与乙方学科组（班主任）结对，每学期一次到乙方学校进行教学指导（不少于3个小时），帮助乙方学科组（班主任队伍）建设，</span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.3pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.03gd" class="MsoNormal"><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi"><span style="font-size:16px">16</span></span></p><p><span style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">
</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">骨干教师（班主任）培养，尤其是学科竞赛的指导。在条件允许的情况下，每年安排一名青田中学急需的学科骨干教师，到乙方开展为期一个学期的支教工作。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">4.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">开展教研组、备课组结对活动，甲方重大教研活动邀请乙方观摩学习，乙方重大教研活动邀请甲方到场指导，共享教育教学最新研究成果。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">5.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲方与乙方共享教学资源（包括自主命制的试卷、自编校本教材与校本练习等）。甲方与乙方高三每学期至少一次共同进行质量检测，甲方帮助乙方分析教学效果及存在的问题，研究提高教学质量的对策。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（二）学生层面</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">开展学生研学夏令营和冬令营活动。分别在暑期和寒假开设夏令营或冬令营。形式分两种。一种为奖励性质，时间为两天，内容为参观绍兴一中及绍兴人文景观，听取若干讲座。人员分两个营，一是英贤卓越营：高一段学习优秀者50人；二是英贤领袖营：各年段优秀班团干部共30人。一种为游学性质，时间为两周，内容为文化补习，人员由高一段组织，活动内容由双方提前共同商定。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">四、项目预算</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年专家劳务费20万，五年共计100万。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">七、实施细则</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">见附件5：《绍兴市第一中学“绍青英贤计划”项目实施细则》</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px">17</span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0