; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:16px"> </span></span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文中宋; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">绍兴市第一中学“英贤计划”项目</span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 26pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></strong></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 26pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></strong></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文中宋; FONT-SIZE: 50pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal">实施细则</span></h1><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">2019</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年6月22日</span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">18</span></span></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">附件1</span></h1><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">“</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">英贤教师岗位津贴”实施细则</span></h1><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目旨在进一步培育学科名师，推进各学科团队（包括竞赛辅导团队）建设，高位践行“求真视野下走向‘博雅’的生本教育”，进而全面提升学校的教育品质和办学品位，使百年一中真正成为以“存古开新、兼容并包”为特质的全国一流江南名校。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目的对象为选聘为英贤教师岗位的在校在职在岗的正高级教师与特级教师以及面向全国招聘的特级教师和正高级教师。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目由学校教科室负责选聘实施。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■项目内容</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">设置“英贤教师岗位”，对通过年度考核，获得聘任的英贤教师，每月补助岗位津贴，每人每年度最高上限为30万元。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■考核要求</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">年度考核要求：每年度考核在合格及以上等次；</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">工作量要求：每年度服从学校安排，满教育教学正常工作量。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">班主任年限要求：担任班主任工作，或教研组长工作，或竞赛辅导工作，或年级长工作，或行政处室管理工作等。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">4.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">专业引领要求：所带班级教学成绩位于年段前三分之一；或有1篇教育教学论文在省级及以上刊物上发表；或主持1项市级及以上课题（含教改项目）；或开发1门市级及以上校本课程；或开设1节市级及以上公开课、观摩课、优质课；或主讲1次市级及以上教育教学类学术报告讲座（经验介绍）；或为主命制1份校级及以上重大考试（期中期末考试、校际联考、高考模拟考试或学校自主招生录取考试等）试卷，或所带学生学科竞赛获得</span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">19</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">省级一等奖及以上；或开设市直级以上名师工作室，指导工作室学员在教育教学等专业技能比赛中取得市直及以上奖项。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（具备其中三项）</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">5.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">援助青田中学要求：根据学校与青田中学的结对协议，按要求结对、带教和培养青田中学来校交流学习的师生。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">6.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">完成学校安排的其他工作任务。</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">引进的高层次人才（</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">省级特级教师、正高级教师）</span><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">享受的津贴待遇：</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 37.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学校补助每人每月除政府人才政策可以享受的奖励之外的岗位津贴，每年度每人最高上限为60万元（含“英贤教师”岗位津贴）。</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">注：</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">①</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">引进人才在我校服务期限至少为五年，每年度通过学校的考核后发放岗位津贴；</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">②</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">平时的收入待遇参照学校的相关政策执行，不低于学校同类学科教师的水平；</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">③</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">服务期满后引进人才可与校方协商继续合约事项。</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">■资金预算</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">每年预算300万，五年总预算1500万。</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">■选聘管理</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">根据《绍兴市第一中学“英贤教师”选聘管理办法》执行。（见附件6）</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">20</span></span></p><p><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">
</span></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">附件2</span></h1><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">“</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">英贤质量奖”实施细则</span></h1><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目旨在奖励在浙江省高考和省级以上学科竞赛中取得优异成绩的年级团队、班级任课教师团队、学科组团队和教育管理团队。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目由学校教学处负责评审实施。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■奖励原则</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">．体现“奖优、奖绩、公平、公开、公正”的原则。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">．奖励标准为班级学科成绩目标达成度和吻合度，重点体现任课教师上课、辅导的实绩与贡献大小。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年依据的年级和班级一段线目标人数一与目标人数二，由学校根据当年的学生实际情况和浙江省高考与高校招生变化情况合理划定。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 22.6pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■奖励项目</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">一段奖。</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">依据高考一段完成情况进行奖励：若未达到市教育局设定的基本目标数但达到基本目标数95%及以上的，按“2万元×班级数”奖励；若达到基本目标数的，按“4万元×班级数”奖励；若超基本目标数的，超1～10人的按每人2万元奖励，超11～20人的从第11人起按每人3万元奖励，超21人及以上的从第21人起按每人4万元奖励。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">省市高分奖</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">。普通类考生获全省前五名的，按每人20万奖励；获全省前6-10名的，按每人10万奖励；获全省前11-100名的，按每人5万元奖励。获全市第一名的，奖励3万元；获全市前2-10名的，按每人2万元奖励。上述人员按最高名次奖励不重复计奖。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">知名高校奖。</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">按清华大学、北京大学、复旦大学、中国人</span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">21</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">民大学、上海财经大学、上海交通大学、中国科学院大学、香港中文大学（深圳）、浙江大学录取情况进行奖励：每录取1人奖0.8万元。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">4.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">顶尖体艺生奖。</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学生被国内高水平体育院校（北京体育大学、上海体育学院）或高水平艺术院校（中央戏剧学院、中央美术学院、中央音乐学院、中国音乐学院、中国传媒大学）录取，按每人1万元奖励；被国内知名体育院校（成都体育学院、吉林体育学院、首都体育学院、天津体育学院、武汉体育学院）或一流艺术院校（北京电影学院、北京舞蹈学院、上海戏剧学院、上海音乐学院、中国美术学院、中国戏曲学院）录取，按每人0.5万元奖励。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">5.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学科竞赛奖。</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">奖励在赞助期内，获得数学、物理、化学、生物、信息学、天文六大学科奥赛金牌的直接辅导教师，其中国际金牌10万/块，洲际金牌3万/块，全国金牌2万/块。同个竞赛年度同类竞赛只取最高奖。<strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"></strong></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■资金预算</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">预算总计为每年200万，五年共1000万。具体分配细则由教学处另行制定。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">22</span></span></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">附件3</span></h1><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">“</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">英贤访学奖”实施细则</span></h1><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目旨在通过国际国内访学，拓展学生的知识见闻、眼见境界，成为具有“抱定宗旨、砥砺德行、博雅通达”的完全人格的未来世界精英，成就最美最好的自己。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目的资助对象为品学兼优但家庭经济条件困难的一中学生。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">本项目由学校教学处、德育处和团委负责评审实施。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■资助条件</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">在以下方面（只要符合其中一项即可）表现优秀且家庭经济条件相对困难的在读学生：</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">文化课程综合成绩优异，具体为：在本学年大规模教学质量调测（一般为绍兴市级及以上的统考、联考等）中，以学生个人成绩的年级排名为依据，名次位列年级前100名。具体认定，由学校教学处统一发布的数据为准。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学科竞赛创新活动成绩优异，具体为：在学科竞赛（数学、物理、化学、生物、信息学、天文学等）中取得全国一等奖及以上的成绩；或者在相关国家级权威机构组织的人文社会学科竞赛（如创新写作、调研报告、探究论文）中取得全国一等奖及以上的成绩；或者在跨学科的、前沿性的综合探究、发明创造活动中，取得了由相关权威机构认定的相当于全国一等奖及以上的成绩或相关的发明专利资质认证等。该项具体由学校教学处评审。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">在善行义举、道德品质等方面有突出典型示范效应，具体为：在弘扬中华传统美德、践行社会主义核心价值观、传播社会正能量等方面，做出典范事迹，获得社会（媒体）广泛关注，为学校、家庭、个人赢得高度赞誉；或者在政府权威部门（如宣传部、文明办、共青团、教育主管部门等）组织的专门评选中，获</span></p><p style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">23</span><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">得市级及以上表彰（如“美德少年”“见义勇为奖”等）。具体由学校德育处评选认定。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■资助标准</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">出国访学对象国包括：美国、德国、英国、加拿大、新西兰、法国、香港、台湾等国家和地区的结对、友好学校（含以后新结对国家和学校）。每年选择其中三个（含）以内地区和学校，出访时间为寒暑假。按照人均2万元（此项目每人共需3万元，其余1万元由学生自行承担）的标准对出访学生进行资助。根据每学年该奖项的受理审核通过情况，确定具体人数。通常情况下，出访团人数不超过30人，出团数量不超过二个（含二个）。同一学生原则上三年中只资助一次。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■资金预算</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt">单位：万元</span></strong></p><table style="BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 100%; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext" class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" width="100%"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 27.05pt; mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes"><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 9.4%; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; HEIGHT: 27.05pt; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt" width="9%"><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 1