ng></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">24</span><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></span></strong></span></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">附件4</span></h1><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </span>“</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">英贤学生奖”实施细则</span></h1><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">为进一步完善学校创新人才培养机制，加快推进各类创新人人才的培养建设，提升学校在高考选考、学科竞赛方面的成绩，奖励成绩特别优异的学生，特制订本细则。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■奖励对象</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">高考总分成绩在全省前100名或绍兴市前三名的学生、学科竞赛获得全国金牌及以上的学生和被清华大学、北京大学录取的学生。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■奖励标准</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.4pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">高考总分获全省前五名的，奖励2万/人；获全省前6-10名的，奖励1万/人；获全省前11-100名的，奖励0.8万/人。获绍兴市前三名的，奖励1万/人。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.4pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">学科竞赛获得全国金牌，奖励1万/人，获得国际金牌，奖励2万/人。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.4pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3. </span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年被清华大学、北京大学、复旦大学、中国人民大学、上海财经大学、上海交通大学、中国科学院大学、香港中文大学（深圳）、浙江大学录取，按实际人数制定奖励标准。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.4pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">以上每个单项只按最高奖计，不重复计奖。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.8pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■资金预算</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年预算20万，五年总预算100万。</span></p><p style="text-align:left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">25</span><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></span></strong></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">附件5</span></h1><h1 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 17pt 0cm 16.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">“</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">绍青英贤计划”项目实施细则</span></h1><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">为了进一步规范“绍青英贤计划项目”，落实结对帮扶的具体工作，经双方协商，特制定 “绍青英贤计划项目” 两校结对帮扶实施细则。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■实施内容</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（一）学校管理</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">双方学校校长为结对帮扶项目实施负责人，具体联络人为双方学校办公室主任。本着诚信与奉献的原则，双方学校认真制定项目实施规划。每年，由双方学校项目负责人带队，组织一次学校管理队伍（3-5人）互访，开展管理工作论坛等活动，就学校管理理念、经验和办法进行分享，帮助乙方提升学校管理水平。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（二）教师培养</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">乙方在每年的4月和10月，派出以学科骨干教师为主的学习团，到甲方交流学习，每次人数10人，为期两周。学习期间，甲方指定学校相应学科骨干教师进行结对指导，对学习团开放全校教师课堂。乙方派出教师全程参与甲方的学科教科研活动，在学习结束开设汇报课。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">乙方在每学年初，选派1-4名青年教师到甲方跟岗学习，以“拜师结对”形式进行，为期半年或一年。甲方指定优秀教师对跟岗教师进行专项指导，指导教师根据跟岗教师情况制定相应指导方案。跟岗教师跟岗学习期间服从甲方的工作安排，在指导师工作时间、工作区域内全程跟岗观摩学习，包括备课上课、教研活动、学生辅导等。跟岗学习期间，每两月安排跟岗教师阶段性总结学习情况，汇报学习成果。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">经双方学校协商，甲方每年安排一名优秀数学或青田中学</span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">26</span><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></span></strong></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">急需的学科骨干教师，到乙方开展支教活动，为期一学期或一学年。乙方可以每学年安排1—2名学科竞赛辅导教师（数学、物理、化学、生物、信息学等）到甲方开展为期一个学期的学科竞赛辅导学习活动，甲方安排优秀学科竞赛辅导教师结对指导。双方学校也可以组织部分优秀教师互换上岗，共享教师资源，互换教师的福利由双方学校各自负责。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">4.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲方安排本校专家教师和优秀班主任，每学期一次到乙方学校进行教学、德育工作指导，帮助乙方学科组、班主任队伍建设和骨干教师、优秀班主任培养以及学科竞赛开展指导，每次为期2天。为保障工作的稳定和延续，甲方所派指导师应有3到5年的稳定性，指导师制定3年工作规划，确定指导方案。乙方教师积极参与指导师的教育指导活动，认真学习，及时完成指导师布置的任务。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（三）学科教研</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲乙双方开展高考学科教研组、备课组校际结对帮扶活动。甲方每学期安排的主题教研活动（以高考研究为主），分享选考高考信息，安排1-2次邀请乙方参加学习，乙方按每个学科2-4人组织参会。乙方每学期安排1-2次教研活动邀请甲方骨干教师到场指导。具体时间和内容由甲乙双方教研组长及备课组长商量决定。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲乙双方建立高考信息与教学资源共享系统，甲方向乙方提供优质教育教学资源，包括自编校本教材和校本练习等。乙方对甲方提供的教学资源根据学情进行整合，最大程度发挥优质资源作用。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲乙双方高三高考学科教师每学期开展一次高考试题研究（7选3科目安排在12月、语、数、英安排在7月）和新老高三对接活动。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（四）考试研究</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲乙双方每学期开展一次试题共研磨题活动。甲方指导乙方学科教师命制高质量检测试卷，并向乙方提供每学期月考、期</span></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">27</span><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></span></strong></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">中、期末等考试的试卷。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">2.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">甲方与乙方的高三年段每学期组织1-2次教学质量监测，甲方帮助乙方分析教学效果及存在的问题，研究提高教学质量的对策。乙方根据甲方诊断，及时调整教学。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">3.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">乙方每学期组织各学科开展一次命题竞赛，甲方学科专家对乙方就命题要求、形制、方向等提出意见，对乙方教师命制的试题考核打分，<img class="anchorclass" />对其中出现的共性问题，提出解决方案。部分优秀试题汇编成集，供两校高三备课组使用。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">（五）学生发展</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">开展学生研学夏令营和冬令营活动。分别在暑期和寒假开设两个营。英贤卓越营，各年段尖子生各10人，共30人。英贤领袖营，各年段优秀班团干部10人，共30人。时间为期1~2周，活动内容主要为文化学习、人文参观等。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class="MsoCommentText"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">■资金预算</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt">每年专家劳务费20万，五年共计100万。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 15pt"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">28</span><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></span></strong></span></p><p style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p>
    
